	},
	text={
		[1]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Stand back!”",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hyah!”",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"The moment we round the corner, we're greeted by a hail of bullets.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"We frantically take cover behind the wall.",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Drop your weapons!”",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“We have you surrounded. If you surrender, your lives will be spared!”",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			{
"Elsa's voice echoes off the walls of the narrow corridor. ",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“So she says.”",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Wanna try making an appeal to your student council president?”",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“And see if she'll go easy on her classmates?”",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Haah, how ridiculous.”",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“The enemies number approximately thirty.”",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“They are Elsa's personal unit.”",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			{
"If all thirty of them open up on us at once, the entire corridor will become a storm of steel. ",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			{
"Hotori and I might be able to survive, but the two girls behind us would never be able to escape unscathed.",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			{
"Akari is particularly vulnerable, even with her Artifact.",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
"At the same time, I hear the sounds of Maki fighting from behind us.",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			{
"Elsa's other detachment has pincered us.",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			{
"...",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			{
"Hotori and I wordlessly share a nod with each other.",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Soujin and I will clear a path.”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'll fight, too.”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“You just worry about getting away.”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Koyuzu, I'm leaving Miyaguni to you.”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Understood.”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			{
"Koyuzu also understands that this is the only way for us to make it out alive.",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“...I put my life in your capable hands.”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Scatter our foes and open a line of retreat.”",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori & Soujin"},
			{
"“Your will be done.” “Your will be done.”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			{
"Our words overlap as one.",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			{
"Fighting spirit surges up from deep within my chest.",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hotori, are you ready?”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Not to die, if that's what you're asking.”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“As if I'd die in a place like this.”",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Good answer.”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			{
"I thrust out my fist, and Hotori meets it with her own.",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			{
"One look into her refreshing eyes tells me she's brimming with the exact same fighting spirit.",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			{
"I never knew she could make eyes like these.",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Let's go.”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah.”",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			{
"As one, we draw our spellblades.",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			{
"At once, the corridor is illumined by Shiranui's flames.",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			{
"They dance and flicker across Hotori's hair-raisingly beautiful expression.",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			{
"Whether as a woman, or as one who fights, all I know is that the endlessly pure feeling I feel in this moment comes from beholding none but her.",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Now!”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			{
"Hotori leaps into action.",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			{
"I follow after her.",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Fire!”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			{
"The corridor is showered in gunfire.",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Shiranui!”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			{
"Yet the bullets never reach us.",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			{
"They are scoured by Shiranui's flames before they ever have the chance.",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“What in the world?!”",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Want a closer look?”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			{
"Shiranui spews forth a blazing dragon of flame that devours the enemy's front ranks.",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			{
"For the briefest of moments, the gunfire ceases.",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Oooooooooaaaaaaahhhh!”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			{
"I carve into the enemy line and reduce them to flaming corpses.",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			{
"Screams and shrieks fill my ears.",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Don't shoot! Watch for friendly fire!”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			{
"They hastily try to mount their bayonets, but that's exactly what I was expecting.",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Too slow!”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Haaaaaah!”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			{
"The two of us make short work of the sluggish enemies.",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			{
"Before a spellblade in close quarters, an unwieldy assault rifle is as useful as a bundle of straw.",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			{
"Even armed to the teeth with cutting-edge weaponry, the enemy soldiers are but lambs to the slaughter.",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			{
"Their front line has completely collapsed.",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			{
"Now, to clear a path through their ranks─",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“The center of their formation!”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Yeah, that's our safest bet.”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			{
"The two of us fly as one into the midst of the enemy.",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			{
"The moment the two leap into the Republican ranks, the battle descends at once into a one-sided pandemonium of slaughter.",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			{
"Standing back-to-back, Soujin and Hotori cover each other with not a single blind spot.",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			{
"Any bullets fired by the terrified Republican soldiers are deflected back by their spellblades.",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			{
"Rather than a mere pair of warriors, what fills the corridor is instead an unstoppable whirlwind of death.",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			{
"As soon as their feet touched the ground, that was the end; the Republican Army has no means of stopping them.",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Haaaaaaah!”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Huuh!”",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			{
"Soujin's heart is filled with an exultation he has never felt before.",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			{
"It is completely different from anything he has felt by\nAkari's side.",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			{
"As his longtime comrade-in-arms, Soujin knows Hotori's heart and mind better than even his own.",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			{
"The same is true of Hotori.",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			{
"She feels naught but overwhelming joy in entrusting her very life to Soujin and being entrusted with his own in return.",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			{
"They have no need of signals or words.",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			{
"Every last one of their senses in concord, the two warriors overcome all corporeal boundaries between them and fuse together as one.",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			{
"Such an ecstasy transcends mere friendship or love.",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			{
"It is a domain of pleasure that only warriors may ever attain.",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Incredible...”",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			{
"Akari is utterly transfixed by the sight of the two.",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			{
"Despite the macabre massacre taking place before her eyes, their fighting forms are irrefutably beautiful.",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			{
"For the very first time, she is bearing witness to the depth of the bonds shared between fellow warriors.",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			{
"She cannot possibly tear her eyes away from the thoroughly mesmerizing spectacle.",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			{
"Yet at the very same time, an overpowering sense of defeat settles deep within her heart.",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			{
"She is made painfully aware that she can never hope to take Hotori's rightful place by his side.",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“So this is what warriors are truly capable of...”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“They have been called the Dragon and Tiger of the Myougikan.”",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“There isn't anyone in the world who could hope to match up to them.”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			{
"Koyuzu struggles to blink the tears from her eyes.",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			{
"As a warrior in her own right, she is moved that she is able to merely witness such a display.",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Fall back! Retreat outside and regroup!”",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			{
"The Republican soldiers immediately turn and flee as soon as Elsa gives the order they'd been desperately waiting for.",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			{
"It is nothing short of a total rout.",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Miyaguni-sama, now's our chance!”",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Yeah, let's go!”",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
